  "source_code": "# cook your dish here\r\nt=int(input())\r\nfor _ in range(t):\r\n    n=int(input())\r\n    a=sorted(map(int,input().split()),reverse=True)\r\n    s=[0]*(3*n+1)\r\n    for i in range(3*n):\r\n        s[i+1]=s[i]+a[i]\r\n    an=0\r\n    for a in range(n+1):\r\n        lw=0\r\n        hg=n-a\r\n        while hg-lw>2:\r\n            m1=lw+(hg-lw)//3\r\n            m2=hg-(hg-lw)//3\r\n            v1=s[a+2*m1]+3*s[3*n-2*a-m1]\r\n            v2=s[a+2*m2]+3*s[3*n-2*a-m2]\r\n            if v1<v2:\r\n                lw=m1\r\n            else:\r\n                hg=m2\r\n        for b in range(lw,hg+1):\r\n            q=a+2*b\r\n            r=3*n-2*a-b\r\n            yxz=2*s[a]+s[q]+3*s[r]\r\n            if yxz>an:\r\n                an=yxz\r\n    \r\n    print(an)",
